Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:07:13.34,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 女双第一轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:07:13.34,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}科斯秋克/斯特恩斯 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs40}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs40}2 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs40}1-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs40}6 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs40}10-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs40}8{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 威廉姆斯姐妹 · 赛后新闻发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Hi Venus and Serena.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗨 维纳斯 塞雷娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:02.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I know it's not the result you wanted,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:02.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道这不是你们想要的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:04.96,EN,,0,0,0,,but I know this comeback together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:04.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我知道这次搭档复出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:06.88,EN,,0,0,0,,in doubles was like four years in the making
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:06.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,打双打 你们等了差不多四年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:07.76,EN,,0,0,0,,and I know you wanted to play
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:07.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道你们本来想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:09.76,EN,,0,0,0,,at Wimbledon, but to do it on home soil,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,在温网打 换成了主场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.76,0:00:12.72,EN,,0,0,0,,just how special was it to finally, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.76,0:00:12.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,终于能够
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:15.28,EN,,0,0,0,,reunite on the doubles court?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,重聚双打场 这感觉多特别？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:16.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I thought it was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 我觉得很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:17.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I thought it was special.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:17.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:19.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I thought it was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:19.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.44,0:00:21.92,EN,,0,0,0,,We kicked off a little rust in the middle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.44,0:00:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们中段打得有点生疏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:23.60,EN,,0,0,0,,of the match and just, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:23.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:24.56,EN,,0,0,0,,we're starting to feel it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,慢慢找到感觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:26.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and it was it was really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:26.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:28.24,EN,,0,0,0,,It was it was really cool to to be able
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,能够
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:31.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to do this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:31.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,再打一次 真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:32.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Anything to add?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,有什么想补充的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:34.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I thought he asked Serena.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:34.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我以为他是问塞雷娜的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:35.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:35.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:41.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Raise your hand just so they see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:41.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,举下手 好让大家看到你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:42.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Having Serena.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:42.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,呃 塞雷娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:44.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Just Serena, I was just curious
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:44.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是想问塞雷娜 我很好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:46.32,EN,,0,0,0,,about how the Wimbledon experience
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,温网那段经历
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:48.32,EN,,0,0,0,,was for you and what the knee injury,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:48.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,对你来说是什么感觉 那个膝伤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.24,EN,,0,0,0,,what that was like, sustaining it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,受伤的那一刻是什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:52.24,EN,,0,0,0,,then recovering from it and and and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:52.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后康复的过程
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:53.92,EN,,0,0,0,,if if you left there wanting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:53.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,你离开那儿的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:55.84,EN,,0,0,0,,to play more or if that was Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:55.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,是还想接着打 还是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.84,0:00:58.96,EN,,0,0,0,,just how you kind of digested it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.84,0:00:58.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么消化这件事的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.96,0:01:01.52,EN,,0,0,0,,That was a little traumatic experience
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.96,0:01:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,那对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:02.80,EN,,0,0,0,,for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:02.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,是一次有点创伤的经历
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:04.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Took me like two hours
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我花了差不多两个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.32,0:01:06.72,EN,,0,0,0,,to leave the locker room that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.32,0:01:06.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,那天晚上才走出更衣室
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:10.40,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's been a long recovery,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,康复的过程很漫长
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:11.44,EN,,0,0,0,,which is something I never thought
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我从来没想过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:13.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I'd say cuz I never thought I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己会说出的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.04,0:01:15.76,EN,,0,0,0,,be here sitting talking to you all again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.04,0:01:15.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,又坐在这儿 跟大家聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:21.60,EN,,0,0,0,,But you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:21.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:23.44,EN,,0,0,0,,what doesn't kill you make you stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:23.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,杀不死你的都会让你更强大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:28.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and so it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:28.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.16,0:01:29.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.16,0:01:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,下一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:32.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Just raise your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:32.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,举手就行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:36.08,EN,,0,0,0,,What was going to make tonight a success
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:36.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚要怎么样才算成功
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:37.76,EN,,0,0,0,,when you take the result out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,抛开比赛结果不谈的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:41.20,EN,,0,0,0,,What did you want to get out of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:41.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,想从这场比赛得到什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:43.28,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, I think we always for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:43.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我们来说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:45.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I think winning is obviously great,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,赢球当然很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:46.48,EN,,0,0,0,,but I think in this position,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:46.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,但站在这个位置上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:48.00,EN,,0,0,0,,just having, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:48.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:50.08,EN,,0,0,0,,fun like we're I didn't come out here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:50.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,开心最重要 我们不是为了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:51.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to win this this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:51.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,赢下这站比赛才来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously, I wanted to do the best
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然 我想尽自己所能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:55.36,EN,,0,0,0,,that I could do, but I think having fun
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:55.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,打到最好 但我觉得开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:58.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and also just seeing how we are and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有看看我们俩状态怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:02:00.40,EN,,0,0,0,,how we feel out there and, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:02:00.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,在场上感觉如何
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:02.08,EN,,0,0,0,,being out there with the fans, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:02.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有跟球迷们在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.08,0:02:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,is just really good just to give them another
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.08,0:02:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些都很好 也是再给他们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:06.32,EN,,0,0,0,,opportunity to see us play.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:06.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,看我们打球的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:10.08,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, it was just really cool really.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的挺棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:14.28,EN,,0,0,0,,And you're answering the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:14.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,下一个问题你来答
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:17.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll pass back to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:17.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 那我转给
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:18.32,EN,,0,0,0,,It's going to be a little bit tricky
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:18.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个问题有点为难
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.32,0:02:20.00,EN,,0,0,0,,because it was a question for Serena,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.32,0:02:20.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为原本是塞雷娜的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:22.24,EN,,0,0,0,,but But obviously
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:22.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:23.20,EN,,0,0,0,,on a Monday night probably
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:23.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,周一晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:24.96,EN,,0,0,0,,the last few years you weren't
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这几年你可能都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:26.80,EN,,0,0,0,,in the cauldron of competition,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:26.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,站在这种竞技的漩涡中心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:29.20,EN,,0,0,0,,loud fans cheering you on or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:29.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,被震天响的球迷加油声包围
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm curious, obviously you played on grass,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你之前打的是草地 我很好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:32.72,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, and had those leadups
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:32.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,有那些赛前热身
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:33.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and had the experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,也有过那种经历
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.68,0:02:36.24,EN,,0,0,0,,but how is it jarring at all to kind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.68,0:02:36.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,但回到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:39.44,EN,,0,0,0,,of get back into a raucous stadium
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这么喧闹的球场 会不适应吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:42.08,EN,,0,0,0,,or is it like riding a bike like, oh yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是说就像骑自行车一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:45.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I this is exactly, you know, comfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:45.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,熟门熟路 完全不陌生？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:46.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say jarring,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:46.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不会说不适应
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:50.96,EN,,0,0,0,,but definitely I wouldn't say surprising,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,但也说不上意外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:53.76,EN,,0,0,0,,but it's it's it's weird because I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:53.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,但确实挺奇怪的 因为我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.76,0:02:54.72,EN,,0,0,0,,so not used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.76,0:02:54.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经很不习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:56.72,EN,,0,0,0,,And I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:58.40,EN,,0,0,0,,so used to having a different night
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经很习惯周一晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:00.32,EN,,0,0,0,,on Monday night, but you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:00.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,是完全不一样的安排
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:02.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and Monday nights are, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:02.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,而现在周一晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:04.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I guess I never know what to expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:04.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我完全没法预料会是什么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:06.56,EN,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:06.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:09.88,EN,,0,0,0,,next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:09.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,下一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:17.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking back to early days
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:17.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在回想早年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:18.64,EN,,0,0,0,,in Southern California,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:18.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,在南加州的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:20.72,EN,,0,0,0,,two young girls hitting balls out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:20.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,两个小女孩从购物篮里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:22.72,EN,,0,0,0,,of a shopping basket
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:22.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,掏球出来打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:24.00,EN,,0,0,0,,with their dad out on the court
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟爸爸一起在球场上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:27.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and I just wonder all these years later,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,这么多年过去了 我很好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:30.48,EN,,0,0,0,,is the joy for the for the game the same
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,打球带来的乐趣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:31.68,EN,,0,0,0,,as it always was?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:31.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,是不是还跟当年一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.68,0:03:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Or are you even enjoying yourself more out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.68,0:03:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是说 现在打球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:34.96,EN,,0,0,0,,there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,反而更享受了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:38.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I think the approach is definitely the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:38.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得心态肯定是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:41.44,EN,,0,0,0,,the process and the method.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,过程和方法都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.44,0:03:44.16,EN,,0,0,0,,And I think that I take a lot of joy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.44,0:03:44.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己从这个过程里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:48.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and perhaps Serena too in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:48.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,得到很多乐趣 塞雷娜大概也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:51.92,EN,,0,0,0,,So I think we've been doing it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们做这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:53.20,EN,,0,0,0,,so long too
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经太久了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and for Serena perhaps she was away
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,塞雷娜可能有过一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:03:57.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and even I was away for a while too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:03:57.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,离开了 我自己也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:04:00.88,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's like going back to ride a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:04:00.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,但这就像重新骑上自行车
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:02.88,EN,,0,0,0,,It's like it's it's what you've always done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是你一直在做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:05.92,EN,,0,0,0,,It's you almost expected of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,几乎是你对自己的期待
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:07.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I think there's joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得里面还是有乐趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:09.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:09.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,为什么不呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:11.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I never really enjoyed the process,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:11.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 我从没真正享受过这过程
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:14.08,EN,,0,0,0,,but I think this time I'm enjoying
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:14.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我觉得这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.08,0:04:16.48,EN,,0,0,0,,the process a little bit more than I've ever
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.08,0:04:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我更享受这个过程 比以往
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:16.80,EN,,0,0,0,,have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,任何时候都多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.88,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's kind of just having a different view
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且现在看待它的角度
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:19.20,EN,,0,0,0,,of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:19.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,也不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:22.08,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's also like this isn't forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且这也不是一辈子的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:24.40,EN,,0,0,0,,This is like not long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:24.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,不会持续太久
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:28.96,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it's also just fun to to know that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以知道这一点 也挺开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:30.88,EN,,0,0,0,,And like I'm not playing every week,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不是每周都在打比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:33.12,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, I'm not showing up every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,不是每周都出现在场上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:35.92,EN,,0,0,0,,you have kids, so it's a little bit different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且有了孩子 情况不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll do two more over there
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 那边再来两个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:42.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and then Yeah, that that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:42.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后 嗯 可以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:44.80,EN,,0,0,0,,For either of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,问你们俩谁都行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.76,EN,,0,0,0,,when you're communicating in doubles,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,打双打的时候你们沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:48.56,EN,,0,0,0,,is that something
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:48.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.56,0:04:51.36,EN,,0,0,0,,that because you're sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.56,0:04:51.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,是不是因为你们是姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:53.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and because you've been together so long
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:53.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,又在一起这么久了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.36,0:04:54.96,EN,,0,0,0,,that that is that something that just kind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.36,0:04:54.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,就自然而然
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:57.60,EN,,0,0,0,,of picks up naturally from the start,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:57.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,从一开始就能默契配合
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:04:58.64,EN,,0,0,0,,even even though you've
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:04:58.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,哪怕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.64,0:05:00.56,EN,,0,0,0,,had a few years not playing together?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.64,0:05:00.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这几年没有一起打过球？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.56,0:05:01.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I think communication
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.56,0:05:01.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得沟通这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:03.12,EN,,0,0,0,,is something you can't take for granted
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,在任何事情上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:03.92,EN,,0,0,0,,in anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:03.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,都不能想当然
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:05.68,EN,,0,0,0,,No matter what, we have to communicate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:05.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我们都得沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:06.96,EN,,0,0,0,,just like any other team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:06.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟别的组合没什么两样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:11.12,EN,,0,0,0,,But I think that we give each other
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:11.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我觉得我们彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:13.60,EN,,0,0,0,,so much grace and encouragement
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:13.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,给了对方很多包容和鼓励
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:16.64,EN,,0,0,0,,that maybe we I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:17.92,EN,,0,0,0,,this is our first time playing together
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:17.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我们隔了这么久
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:18.96,EN,,0,0,0,,in forever too
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一次一起打球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:21.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think we really were getting our stride
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:21.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们确实慢慢找到了节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.84,0:05:22.48,EN,,0,0,0,,for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.84,0:05:22.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:24.16,EN,,0,0,0,,So this is this was great for us
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:24.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这次对我们来说很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:26.88,EN,,0,0,0,,to like get out there and do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:26.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,能站上场去打这一场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:30.56,EN,,0,0,0,,But communication is like always key
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,但沟通永远是关键
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:32.64,EN,,0,0,0,,like every point you can't just be like read
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:32.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一分都不能指望
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:35.04,EN,,0,0,0,,my mind being we have to still speak
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:35.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,对方能读懂心思 得开口说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:36.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,互相说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:38.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay we'll do two more comments Dave
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:38.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 戴夫那边再来两个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:40.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and then to mine
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:40.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后轮到我这边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:41.84,EN,,0,0,0,,hometown tournaments are bit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,主场作战这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.20,EN,,0,0,0,,of a rare thing in tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,在网球里挺少见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:45.04,EN,,0,0,0,,so tonight Peyton Stearns
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚斯特恩斯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:48.24,EN,,0,0,0,,is from Mason Ohio
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:48.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是俄亥俄州梅森人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:49.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and we talked to her and Marta downstairs
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们楼下采访了她和玛尔塔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:50.96,EN,,0,0,0,,for a few minutes and they talked
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,聊了几分钟 她们说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:53.20,EN,,0,0,0,,about how special this match was for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场球对她们来说有多特别
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:54.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Can you talk a little bit about Payton
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:54.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,能不能聊聊佩顿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:58.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and Marta and your thoughts on them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有玛尔塔 你们怎么看她们？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:06:00.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:06:00.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个 我也说不好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:03.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel like Payton I to play
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:03.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得佩顿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,in your hometown, she's from Mason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,能在自己家乡打球 她是梅森人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:08.48,EN,,0,0,0,,That's kind of awesome to be able to play
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:08.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,能在这么大一站比赛里打球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:10.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in such a big tournament that's literally
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且就在自己家门口
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:11.36,EN,,0,0,0,,in your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:11.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,这挺酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:13.52,EN,,0,0,0,,So that's that must be really special
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:13.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对她来说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:14.72,EN,,0,0,0,,for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:14.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,肯定特别有意义
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.72,0:06:16.32,EN,,0,0,0,,And I love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.72,0:06:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:17.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I love, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:19.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I love following all the American girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:19.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,关注所有美国小将
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:20.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I just really am big fans
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的是她们的铁杆粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:22.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and always supporting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直支持她们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:26.64,EN,,0,0,0,,And and then Marta is I hit
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:26.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有玛尔塔 我在温网
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:27.52,EN,,0,0,0,,with her at Wimbledon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟她打过球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:29.20,EN,,0,0,0,,and she was just it was just different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:29.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉很不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:30.24,EN,,0,0,0,,It was just so nice. She
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,特别好 她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,was so it was really awesome
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟她打球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:32.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to hit with her and just to get
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:32.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很棒 也借这个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:35.68,EN,,0,0,0,,to know her as much as I could while hitting
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:35.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,尽量多了解她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:37.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and and training together,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:37.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,一起训练的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:38.64,EN,,0,0,0,,but it was still fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:38.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:41.84,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, I I really like, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我特别喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:45.20,EN,,0,0,0,,when she does back flips.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,她做后空翻的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:46.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, last one to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:46.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 最后一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:48.88,EN,,0,0,0,,finally I'm just curious which one
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:48.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很好奇 到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:50.88,EN,,0,0,0,,of you just decided to play doubles again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,先提议要重新打双打的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:52.72,EN,,0,0,0,,What was that conversation like deciding
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:52.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,那次决定重返双打场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:56.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to get back on the doubles court?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:56.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,对话是什么样的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:06:57.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Um
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:06:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:07:00.56,EN,,0,0,0,,yeah, I I think we've waited a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:07:00.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们等这一天
